{
  "work_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus",
  "source_path": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    },
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-13",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0004",
      "source_sha256": "c88a7ba023fd10d9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He also spoke again about the consolation of the soul, making it clear that nothing in human life is lasting except suffering and hardship."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0015",
      "source_sha256": "fa8d65cbb155063e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And the farmers rejoice greatly, confident that they can pay their taxes from their fields."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0033",
      "source_sha256": "2d16691928735072",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They honor the one who renounced the world and his possessions and received the perfect kingdom."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0050",
      "source_sha256": "7dc310fefeb938c9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You are a virgin like Elijah, and you have never joined yourself to a woman."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0152",
      "source_sha256": "17016f439b3f8169",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Restore the little boy’s soul once more. And through the prayers of Saint Victor, he opened his eyes."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0156",
      "source_sha256": "90c460fe162b0905",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You raised the little boy for his parents after he had died."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0162",
      "source_sha256": "d8c87a02d8098365",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He brought all his possessions and his slaves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0188",
      "source_sha256": "5d698910fbc08c8a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They saw that she was in danger of dying."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0203",
      "source_sha256": "ebbb4e34f27208b2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when he said these things, she stopped looking at him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0219",
      "source_sha256": "8b05657c229b640f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And she pleased him by reinforcing the apse of the altar and the wooden fittings of the martyr’s shrine with pure gold, commemorating the honor of the saint."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0220",
      "source_sha256": "b3857ec83d57b8d6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he had craftsmen brought who were masters of their craft."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0221",
      "source_sha256": "e096fa2d8950a834",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They worked on the altar to furnish it with gold."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0222",
      "source_sha256": "77cebc9872c711e9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But while they were still working on the wooden fittings, the devil, who hates what is good, struck one of the craftsmen who were working."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0223",
      "source_sha256": "a754670832353f70",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He fell down."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0239",
      "source_sha256": "f908d95d28039ef6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He made the sign of the cross over me and took away my fear, saying, “Do not be afraid. I am Victor, whose martyr’s shrine you are working on.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0240",
      "source_sha256": "20eb67d51d2458b8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And immediately I stopped seeing him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0241",
      "source_sha256": "cdc12ddf460ec8e4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the crowd heard these things, they cried out, “The God of Saint Victor is one!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0242",
      "source_sha256": "7011cf004534b8f3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And so, through the zeal of the God-loving king and the miracles of Saint Victor, they fitted out the [?] and the altar with fine gold and precious stones of great value."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0243",
      "source_sha256": "768a2052efa0bfe5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You have seen, my beloved, how great are the miracles of Saint Victor, whose feast we are celebrating today."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0244",
      "source_sha256": "36dbc8d13ac7cbdd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And everyone who appeals to him with all their heart, even if they are suffering from any illness, he grants them healing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0245",
      "source_sha256": "cbcf4c942783b4c6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There was also a man in this city who was a patrician in the service of the emperors. He fell ill with an incurable disease."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0246",
      "source_sha256": "56bae95510dc573c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His whole body swelled up until he was as thick as a pillar."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0247",
      "source_sha256": "2798371a77fb039b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And it was heartbreaking to see him in this wretched condition."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0248",
      "source_sha256": "48f9045b87c385e3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He was in distress and great, unbearable pain, so that you would often find him sitting down,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0249",
      "source_sha256": "e802e21120764e41",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "with his servants gathered around him. His feet and limbs would burst open and discharge large amounts of foul matter."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0250",
      "source_sha256": "ac86e1a25c7220cc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he gave large sums of money to the doctors."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0251",
      "source_sha256": "b245efe7da523c02",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "No relief came to him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0252",
      "source_sha256": "b4d98bfeb170118f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Indeed, the emperors of Rome sent chief physicians, because he was an important man in the palace. These men made every effort, but he gained no relief."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0253",
      "source_sha256": "2648e86b3a2d113e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While he was in this great suffering, he heard about the miracles and wonders taking place at the sanctuary of Saint Apa Victor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0254",
      "source_sha256": "49c06343f5f66f52",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His servants lifted him up and brought him to the saint’s sanctuary."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0255",
      "source_sha256": "26dc8155a8e3eb67",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They placed him in front of the altar."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0256",
      "source_sha256": "a8280de9ce26dba7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he cried out day and night, saying, “Saint Victor, look upon my misery and my suffering, and grant me healing, for I am suffering terribly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0257",
      "source_sha256": "1d6781351c3af68d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Or let your mercy reach me, and appeal to God on my behalf, so that he may take me out of this life, for look, you see my distress.” That night,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0258",
      "source_sha256": "3063d9daa2308111",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he dozed off for a short time."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0259",
      "source_sha256": "b02c0fdd1f1d64b2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then Saint Victor took pity on him in his misfortune, because he loves humankind."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0260",
      "source_sha256": "ebf4755a7cbe2d86",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He saw him in a vision, clothed in great glory,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0261",
      "source_sha256": "955a584c50e10201",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "wearing a beautiful purple robe and a golden belt,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0262",
      "source_sha256": "6e1b372e08aae7a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and sending out rays of light. And he said in the vision, “What illness makes you suffer like this?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0263",
      "source_sha256": "9204c6edaa83f726",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The man said to him, “Look, you see my suffering and my distress, for I have come close to death.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.000.0264",
      "source_sha256": "9696bb3e3ada2786",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-13",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The saint said to him with a cheerful face, “I am the one who will heal you, so that you may know that I have power to do anything through the grace of God that is with me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0003",
      "source_sha256": "4b2c99965a4d9173",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He told them about the vision he had seen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0034",
      "source_sha256": "8b862aba9afa4723",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He fell ill and suffered a rupture in his inner part, namely the [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0039",
      "source_sha256": "0cafa5f8dd53a43e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The man gave great gifts to the sanctuary of Saint Victor."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0052",
      "source_sha256": "ecddc5265fae0e8c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After this, God put it into his heart to go to the martyr’s shrine of the holy Father Victor and plead with him, so that he would surely heal him of his illness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0059",
      "source_sha256": "90f4ac337438d5dc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Help me, because I am ashamed to have anyone see me because of what has happened to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0079",
      "source_sha256": "11e2e0e95465bc2c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Only do not neglect what he told you, and you will recover."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0080",
      "source_sha256": "b82e35ea4e321ac4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When Saint Victor had said these things to the leper, he left him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0081",
      "source_sha256": "85b818b54990b2a4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Immediately he awoke from the vision, trembling with fear."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0082",
      "source_sha256": "38559d25898c3fe9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he smelled a strong, pleasant fragrance around his sleeping place, like fine incense."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0083",
      "source_sha256": "5c0ebc72751dab4f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to himself, “Truly, it was Saint Victor who came to me to grant me healing.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0093",
      "source_sha256": "fce06d141b0444c9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "They went down to the cistern from which the basins of the place are filled."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0110",
      "source_sha256": "85cf4070acae8e84",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Who among all the philosophers in the world can praise you as you deserve, O you who offered your body as a living sacrifice, holy, acceptable, and pleasing to God?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0119",
      "source_sha256": "74d84fa2608c78f4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "The God-loving king was there with his army of soldiers, because it was the feast of Saint Victor. My father Innocent was also there with all the clergy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0162",
      "source_sha256": "1b3616383a3c499a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "If we are strangers and foreigners on earth, then we ought to keep thinking about our eternal home, which is the kingdom of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0163",
      "source_sha256": "6586cb783f00c3e5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "We will enter it with ease if we keep the commandments entrusted to us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0164",
      "source_sha256": "aca757175dc51ad3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "We were born [?] to inherit the earth, but for the earth to inherit [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0165",
      "source_sha256": "61b8cccb6aa81852",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "For the earth is the home of every human being."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0166",
      "source_sha256": "4977e5e00ba2a6c6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Since we entered this world weeping, we will also leave weeping. We came sighing, and we will also leave sighing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0182",
      "source_sha256": "3a93e2bf44669133",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Do not let us base our security on the illusions of wealth. You do not know when you will be summoned."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.001.0257",
      "source_sha256": "3f47cb518d6c6e16",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "But the straw will be burned in a fire that cannot be extinguished."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0017",
      "source_sha256": "181cc5b769efb72f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "And again: “The ungodly person is like chaff that the wind blows away from the face of the earth.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0083",
      "source_sha256": "a96f7386694591cb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "The mouth closed and stopped speaking well. The voice grew weak. The ears stopped hearing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0099",
      "source_sha256": "19e570881b080e11",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Where will you turn your face, O poor man? Or where will you look while you are being laid to rest, when there is neither right nor left?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0200",
      "source_sha256": "da1aebf9bc3085b8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Finally, he fell ill with the sickness from which he would die."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0207",
      "source_sha256": "478defa352c38619",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "His son took control of his wealth and his property."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0217",
      "source_sha256": "359de01354726bc1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "I send them for the offering and the firstfruits so that they may hold the service. Otherwise, I will not give this quantity of wine. Instead, I will keep them and put them toward the payment of taxes and my hired worker."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0274",
      "source_sha256": "3e2e89457b7f1a7a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "And when you leave the body, your soul will not be separated from him, because I received him as a gift before God. And he gave him the good things of the kingdom of heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0276",
      "source_sha256": "97786d151dc7e201",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Do you think that the martyrs endured these sufferings in vain?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0297",
      "source_sha256": "469cfa8834c5d2ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Do not be sexually immoral, because God will destroy whoever defiles God's temple."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0305",
      "source_sha256": "ff3f91fc24f75959",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "Do not be double-tongued, because being double-tongued is a double-edged sword."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_celestinus#CopScr.pseudo-celestinus.002.0318",
      "source_sha256": "764294c2131df8d3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 21,
      "text": "But through the zeal and care of Purot, the deacon most beloved of God."
    }
  ]
}
